  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing YUNGA Challenge badges for Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project will adapt FAO YUNGA non-formal educational resources on climate change, environment and other sustainability issues through a participatory approach with UNICEF, Government and the NGO community. The project will target primary and secondary school age children to raise capacity and promote action on environmental issues which are at the core mandates of FAO and UNICEF.</narrative>
  </description>
